35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"I found out that the prefecture's publicly run beds cost 1,100 yen per night per student, including hall and equipment use. Also, two clubs that went inland last summer had to sleep eight to a room with lights out at eleven. It seems like we need to consider both cost and comfort.","{""words"":52,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I see. The vacation timetable for our own hall is already quite packed, so a continuous block would mean training split between early mornings and late evenings. Additionally, the attendance sheets for the away camps show that a fifth of the membership never came at all, and most of those names had gone from the register by winter. It's concerning, and we need to think about how to improve attendance.","{""words"":70,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I found that group transport accounted for 38% of the total expenses the year the club went furthest, compared to just 9% the year it stayed local. Also, the canteen closure during the vacation block means we'd have to cook for ourselves, which took the duty pair two hours a day last year. We should consider these factors when deciding on our destination.","{""words"":63,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"I found out that the seniors who were asked all trace the year-groups actually mixing to the evenings after sessions, which only happen when everyone is sleeping in the same place. Also, the attendance sheets for the away camps show a fifth of the membership never came at all, and most of those names had gone from the register by winter. It's important to consider these factors when planning our camp.","{""words"":71,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"I found that whole-building lets at small inns are quoted on a headcount fixed weeks ahead with the deposit non-refundable, so anyone who drops out late is paid for by the rest. Also, mapping the membership list against first-train times, a third of the club cannot be on campus by nine in the morning without paying for a bed the night before. We need to consider these factors when deciding on our destination and planning the schedule.","{""words"":77,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, that's a lot of absences. @Ryuji, 38% is a big chunk of the budget. @Rin, it's interesting that the mixing happens in the evenings. @Misaki, that's a lot of people who can't make it early. It seems like we have a lot to consider. Maybe we should think about a destination that's not too far, so transport costs are lower, but also has enough space for everyone to be comfortable.","{""words"":71,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Ryuji"",""Rin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, indeed, the absences are concerning. Perhaps we should consider a destination that is not too far but still offers a change of scenery to encourage attendance. @Ryuji, the transport costs are significant. Maybe we can look for a place that balances cost and comfort. @Rin, the evenings seem crucial for mixing year-groups. We should ensure our destination has common areas for everyone to gather. @Misaki, the first-train times are an important factor. We need to choose a destination that is accessible for everyone.","{""words"":84,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Ryuji"",""Rin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, I agree that 38% is a significant portion of the budget. @Shizue, perhaps we can look for a destination that is closer to home to reduce transport costs. @Rin, the evenings are indeed important for mixing year-groups. We should ensure our destination has common areas for everyone to gather. @Misaki, the first-train times are an important factor. We need to choose a destination that is accessible for everyone. Maybe we should consider a place that is not too far but still offers a change of scenery and has good transport links.","{""words"":92,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shizue"",""Rin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mio, I agree that we need to consider a destination that's not too far to keep transport costs lower. @Shizue, a change of scenery might indeed encourage more people to attend. @Ryuji, common areas are important for mixing year-groups. @Misaki, accessibility is key, so we should consider a place with good transport links. Maybe we should look into places that offer a balance of cost, comfort, and accessibility.","{""words"":68,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shizue"",""Ryuji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, I agree that we need to find a balance between cost and comfort. @Shizue, perhaps we can look for a destination that offers a change of scenery but is still within a reasonable travel distance. @Ryuji, common areas are indeed important for mixing year-groups. @Rin, accessibility is key, so we should consider places with good transport links. Maybe we should consider a destination that is not too far, has good transport links, and offers a change of scenery.","{""words"":79,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shizue"",""Ryuji"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, maybe we can find a place that has a canteen or dining options nearby so we don't have to spend too much time cooking. @Ryuji, do you think it's possible to find a place that's not too far but still has enough space for everyone? @Rin, what do you think about looking for a place with common areas where everyone can gather in the evenings? @Misaki, is there a way to find a place that's not too expensive but still comfortable and accessible for everyone?","{""words"":86,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Ryuji"",""Rin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, that's a good point about the canteen. @Ryuji, I think it's possible to find a place that's not too far but still has enough space. @Rin, common areas are indeed important for mixing year-groups. @Misaki, perhaps we can find a place that offers a balance of cost, comfort, and accessibility. Let's consider all these factors when deciding on our destination.","{""words"":61,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Ryuji"",""Rin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, I think it's possible to find a place that's not too far but still has enough space. @Shizue, I agree that common areas are important. @Rin, I think we should prioritize places with good common areas for mixing year-groups. @Misaki, perhaps we can find a place that offers a balance of cost, comfort, and accessibility. Let's consider all these factors when deciding on our destination.","{""words"":66,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shizue"",""Rin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Mio, I agree that having a canteen or dining options nearby would be great. @Shizue, I think it's important to find a place that has enough space and common areas for everyone to gather. @Ryuji, I agree that we should prioritize places with good common areas. @Misaki, I think we should look for a place that offers a balance of cost, comfort, and accessibility. Maybe we can find a place that's not too far, has good transport links, and has a canteen or dining options nearby.","{""words"":86,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shizue"",""Ryuji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, I agree that having dining options nearby would be beneficial. @Shizue, I think it's important to find a place that balances cost, comfort, and accessibility. @Ryuji, I agree that common areas are crucial for mixing year-groups. @Rin, perhaps we can find a place that's not too far, has good transport links, and offers dining options nearby. Let's consider all these factors when deciding on our destination.","{""words"":67,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shizue"",""Ryuji"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"I think we have a good idea of what to consider now. Let's summarize: we need a destination that is not too far to keep transport costs low, has enough space for everyone, offers a change of scenery, has good transport links, and has common areas for mixing year-groups. Additionally, having dining options nearby would be beneficial. Does that sound good to everyone?","{""words"":63,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,That sounds like a comprehensive list of considerations. I agree with Mio's summary. It's important that we find a destination that meets all these criteria to ensure a successful and enjoyable training camp for everyone.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree with the summary. It's crucial that we find a destination that balances cost, comfort, accessibility, and provides opportunities for year-group mixing. Let's make sure we consider all these factors when making our decision.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I agree with the summary. It's important to find a place that's not too far, has good transport links, and offers a change of scenery. Common areas for mixing year-groups and dining options nearby are also crucial. Let's make sure we find a destination that meets all these criteria.","{""words"":49,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with the summary. It's important to find a destination that balances cost, comfort, accessibility, and provides opportunities for year-group mixing. Let's make sure we consider all these factors when making our decision.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
